GIVEN l IS A `A claimed loss`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`VII.3 — what Bao Minh pays where it repairs or replaces` l MEANS
    min (l's `cost of restoring the item to its condition before the loss`)
        (l's `item`'s `sum insured`)

§§ `VIII.1(b) — electronic data processing media`

-- The basis of valuation is the cost of blank media plus the cost of copying the data
-- from back-up or from originals of a previous generation, without research, engineering,
-- or the cost of recreating or gathering the data. If the media are not repaired, replaced
-- or restored, the basis is the cost of blank media. The value of the data to anyone is
-- not covered, even where the data cannot be recreated.
