GIVEN l IS A `A claimed loss`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`VIII.1(b) — the value of electronic data processing media` l MEANS
    IF   l's `the media were repaired, replaced or restored`
    THEN l's `cost of blank media` PLUS l's `cost of copying the data from back-up or from originals`
    ELSE l's `cost of blank media`

§§ `The measure of a loss`

-- Which measure applies: reinstatement where Bao Minh elected it (VII.3); the media basis
-- for data processing media (VIII.1(b), which applies "Cho dù có bất kỳ điều khoản nào có
-- nội dung khác đi"); otherwise the preamble's value at the time of loss for a destroyed
-- item, or the amount of the damage.
GIVEN c IS A `The claim`
      l IS A `A claimed loss`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the measure of the loss` c l MEANS
  BRANCH
    IF l's `item`'s `electronic data processing media`  THEN `VIII.1(b) — the value of electronic data processing media` l
    IF c's `Bao Minh elected to repair or replace`       THEN `VII.3 — what Bao Minh pays where it repairs or replaces` l
    OTHERWISE `preamble — the value at the time of loss, or the amount of the damage` l

§§ `VII.5 — the average condition`

-- If at the time of the DAMAGE the insured property's actual value exceeds its sum
-- insured, the Insured bears a share of the loss in the proportion of the under-insurance,
-- item by item. The condition speaks of property ("tài sản ... có trị giá thực tế"); it
-- is not applied to loss of rent, which has no actual value (fork F12).
-- src:330 | 5. Luật tỷ lệ (bảo hiểm dưới giá trị)
-- src:331 | Tại thời điểm xảy ra TỔN HẠI, nếu tài sản được bảo hiểm có trị giá thực tế lớn hơn số tiền bảo
-- src:332 | hiểm của tài sản đó thì Người được bảo hiểm phải tự chịu một phần tổn thất tương ứng với tỉ lệ bảo
-- src:333 | hiểm dưới giá trị. Điều kiện này sẽ được áp dụng riêng biệt đối với mỗi hạng mục tài sản được bảo
-- src:334 | hiểm.
GIVEN i IS AN `An item of insured property`
      `the loss` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`VII.5 — the loss after the average condition` i `the loss` MEANS
    IF   i's `actual value at the time of the DAMAGE` GREATER THAN i's `sum insured`
    THEN `the loss` TIMES (i's `sum insured` DIVIDED BY i's `actual value at the time of the DAMAGE`)
    ELSE `the loss`

§§ `VII.6 — contribution`

-- First paragraph: where the property was also insured by the Insured or its agent under
-- other policies, Bao Minh is liable only for its rateable share. The basis of the ratio
-- is not stated; the sums insured are used, as the Law on Insurance Business does for
-- double insurance (fork F19, LAW).
-- Second paragraph: where the other policy carries a clause by which it does not pay, or
-- pays only rateably, Bao Minh's liability is limited to the loss in the proportion of the
-- sum insured to the value of the property.
