-- A, B, C and D have no paragraph of their own; Section IV governs them.
DECLARE `How a deductible is counted` IS ONE OF
    `once for each loss`
    `once for each loss at each location`
    `once for each loss at each location, on losses not caused by fire`
    `once for each loss, only on impact by the Insured's own vehicle or animal`

GIVEN r IS A `A risk in Section II`
GIVETH A `How a deductible is counted`
`how the deductible is counted under` r MEANS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `E. malicious damage`                       THEN `once for each loss at each location`
    WHEN `F. earthquake or volcanic eruption`        THEN `once for each loss at each location, on losses not caused by fire`
    WHEN `G. storm and tempest`                      THEN `once for each loss at each location`
    WHEN `H. storm, tempest and flood`               THEN `once for each loss at each location`
    WHEN `I. water from tanks, apparatus or pipes`   THEN `once for each loss at each location`
    WHEN `J. impact by vehicles or animals`          THEN `once for each loss, only on impact by the Insured's own vehicle or animal`
    OTHERWISE `once for each loss`

§§ `The amount payable`

-- The amount for the covered losses at one location, split by whether fire caused them
-- (risk F needs the split).
GIVEN c IS A `The claim`
      loc IS A `The loss at one location`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the amount for the losses at the location` c loc MEANS
    sum (map (GIVEN l YIELD `the amount for the loss after the conditions` c l) (loc's `claimed losses`))

GIVEN c IS A `The claim`
      loc IS A `The loss at one location`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the amount for the losses at the location caused by fire` c loc MEANS
    sum (map (GIVEN l YIELD `the amount for the loss after the conditions` c l)
             (filter (GIVEN l YIELD l's `caused by fire`) (loc's `claimed losses`)))

-- Risk F: at one location, the losses caused by fire bear no deductible; the others bear it.
GIVEN c   IS A `The claim`
      loc IS A `The loss at one location`
      `the deductible` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`F — the amount at the location, the deductible on losses not caused by fire` c loc `the deductible` MEANS
    `by fire` PLUS `after the deductible`
    WHERE
        `by fire` MEANS `the amount for the losses at the location caused by fire` c loc
        `not by fire` MEANS `the amount for the losses at the location` c loc MINUS `by fire`
        `after the deductible` MEANS
            IF   `not by fire` GREATER THAN `the deductible`
            THEN `not by fire` MINUS `the deductible`
            ELSE 0

-- The deductible applied as the risk's paragraph counts it, then the claim cap of the
-- proviso. `the covered losses` are the locations with only their covered losses in them.
GIVEN c                   IS A `The claim`
      `the covered losses` IS A LIST OF `The loss at one location`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the amount payable on the covered losses` c `the covered losses` MEANS
    min (`proviso — the most Bao Minh pays on the claim` c) `after the deductible`
    WHERE
        `the deductible` MEANS
            `IV — the deductible the Policy Summary states for the risk` (c's `Policy Summary`) (c's `risk claimed under`)
        `at each location` MEANS
            map (GIVEN loc YIELD `the amount for the losses at the location` c loc) `the covered losses`
        `in all` MEANS sum `at each location`
        `after the deductible` MEANS
            CONSIDER `how the deductible is counted under` (c's `risk claimed under`)
            WHEN `once for each loss` THEN
                max 0 (`in all` MINUS `the deductible`)
            WHEN `once for each loss at each location` THEN
                sum (map (GIVEN x YIELD max 0 (x MINUS `the deductible`)) `at each location`)
            WHEN `once for each loss at each location, on losses not caused by fire` THEN
                sum (map (GIVEN loc YIELD `F — the amount at the location, the deductible on losses not caused by fire` c loc `the deductible`)
                         `the covered losses`)
            WHEN `once for each loss, only on impact by the Insured's own vehicle or animal` THEN
                IF   c's `facts`'s `the vehicle or animal was owned or controlled by the Insured, the occupier of the insured premises, or their employees`
                THEN max 0 (`in all` MINUS `the deductible`)
                ELSE `in all`
